WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,480
But the body is not broken

2
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,080
The gun body line can no longer hold up

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,480
It's not a failure of the spiritual bullet

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:09,280
It's because the weapon carrying him is not stable enough

5
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,280
I'll be slower next time

6
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:15,050
Stop thinking about it

7
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,180
How come your support flies so fast?

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,380
Just search and you'll be there

9
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,580
It can be controlled by covering and supporting with spiritual power

10
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:23,180
To put it simply, it is the remnant of spiritual power. I want to learn this.

11
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,180
I want to learn that too

12
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:25,180
Everybody wants to learn

13
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:29,940
But I have just learned to absorb and release spiritual energy

14
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,540
Zhao Tang can only teach you

15
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:36,170
Can you give me another one? I just took one.

16
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:37,370
I didn’t expect it would be consumed so quickly

17
00:00:37,970 --> 00:00:44,550
Wait. I'll go get it. If you have anything to say, tell me.

18
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:45,550
Don't stare at me like that

19
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:47,850
Wen Chen accepts you

20
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:49,050
Is it because you are great?

21
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:54,010
Regardless of the reason, right?

22
00:00:54,210 --> 00:00:56,620
Wen Chen won’t accept you either
